  "description": "On-build code context maps for .NET. After every successful build it reads the built assemblies and writes a deterministic structural map (project graph, types, interface implementers, base types, and the public and internal member surface) plus a compact digest into AgentDocumentation/ContextMap, so cheaper or local AI models can navigate a codebase without re-deriving it. Build-only and non-fatal; reads finished assemblies, never opens an MSBuild workspace.",
